OL,3,GNEWSARural crime survey 'will shape
OL,4,Apriorities', says Durham police
OL,5,Acommissioner
OL,6,
OL,7,FResults of a survey on rural crime in
OL,8,FCounty Durham will be used to help
OL,9,Fdirect resources and shape future
OL,10,Faction, a police chief has said.
OL,12,FDurham and Darlington's Police and
OL,13,FCrime Commissioner (PCC), Joy Allen,
OL,14,Flaunched an initiative to gather
OL,15,Ffeedback from residents, landowners,
OL,16,Ffarmers and rural business owners.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
