OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARural crime survey 'will shape
OL,4,Apriorities', says Durham police
OL,5,Acommissioner
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe issues prioritised included
OL,8,Ffly-tipping, off-road bikes and
OL,9,Fagricultural and machinery theft as
OL,10,Fwell as the need to strengthen
OL,11,Freporting, improve police visibility
OL,12,Fand build confidence.
OL,14,FAllen said the findings highlighted
OL,15,Fboth the challenges faced by rural
OL,16,Fcommunities and the strong appetite for
OL,17,Fcontinued investment and targeted
OL,18,Faction.
